    <sys:String x:Key="Profile.MaxPerformance.Hint">Gaming plus everything for speed</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Profile.Recommended.Long">Fewer ads, tips and distractions in Windows. All tweaks have a low risk.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Profile.Gaming.Long">More performance and less delay in games.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Profile.Privacy.Long">Windows sends much less data to Microsoft. Copilot and Recall are hidden.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Profile.Telemetry.Long">Turns off diagnostic, error and usage data sent to Microsoft, plus Edge and Chrome statistics.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Profile.Battery.Long">Less background load and effects, power mode set to efficiency, programs no longer start automatically.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Profile.Office.Long">A tidy Windows for work: fast startup, no ads and no gaming apps.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="Profile.MaxPerformance.Long">Everything from Gaming plus timer resolution, fewer effects and the Best performance power mode. Contains medium-risk tweaks.</sys:String>
